@startuml docs/billing/organization-quota.puml
title "User Creates an Organization (Plan Quota)"

actor User
participant "Browser"
participant "Organization Switcher"
participant "better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)"
participant "beforeCreateOrganization hook"
database "Database (Prisma)"

== Nominal Case (200) ==
User ->> Browser: Click "Create organization"
Browser ->> "Organization Switcher": create()
"Organization Switcher" ->> "better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)": POST {name, slug}
"better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)" ->> "beforeCreateOrganization hook": {user}
"beforeCreateOrganization hook" ->> "Database (Prisma)": subscription.findMany({userId, status in active|trialing})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "beforeCreateOrganization hook": plans -> highest tier (else free plan)
note right of "beforeCreateOrganization hook": limit = quotas.max_organizations\n-1 (UNLIMITED) short-circuits
"beforeCreateOrganization hook" ->> "Database (Prisma)": organizationMember.count({userId, role: "owner"})
"Database (Prisma)" -->> "beforeCreateOrganization hook": current < limit
"beforeCreateOrganization hook" -->> "better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)": allowed
"better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)" ->> "Database (Prisma)": organization.create + owner member
"better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)" -->> "Organization Switcher": 200 {organization}
"Organization Switcher" ->> Browser: setActive + toast success
Browser -->> User: New organization active

== Edge Case: Quota Exceeded (403) ==
note right of "beforeCreateOrganization hook": current >= limit
"beforeCreateOrganization hook" -->> "better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)": APIError FORBIDDEN (quota_exceeded)
"better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)" -->> "Organization Switcher": 403 "Your plan allows N organization(s)."
"Organization Switcher" ->> Browser: toast.error(error.message)
Browser -->> User: Prompted to upgrade

== Edge Case: No Free Plan Seeded (500) ==
note right of "Database (Prisma)": no active tier "free" row
"beforeCreateOrganization hook" -->> "better-auth (/api/auth/organization/create)": Error "No free plan configured — run seed:plans"

== Downstream: Per-Organization Quotas ==
note over "Database (Prisma)": max_projects / max_org_members stay org-scoped\n(assertProjectQuota, assertSeatAvailable)\nand are no longer multipliable by new organizations
@enduml
